5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I want to know which past projects actually worked for the people using them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I’m concerned about how much disruption the timetable absorbs during construction.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect the approved figures are fiction. I want to see the actual costs versus estimates.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried the paper numbers don’t match the real market prices anymore.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I worry about the staff already stretched thin. We need to see if this adds burden.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, your point on disruption is key. We must verify if rooms are actually used.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, agreed. We need hard data on room availability and actual booking rates.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, timelines are symptoms. I’m more interested in the tender records to see if bids were realistic.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, I agree. If bids were padded, the budget is already broken before we start.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Benjamin, valid. But if the schedule slips, the disruption drags on. We need to check delivery schedules.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
